# Keep line endings consistent for everyone and every tool.
# Without this, files committed from Windows arrive with CRLF, which makes
# prettier/eslint fail on every line of the file and turns any later edit into
# a whole-file diff. `text=auto eol=lf` normalises on commit and checks out LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

